    ('f5fb20cd-4ca7-5bb5-9728-5631f4d40086'::uuid, 'AJ Antunes Breakfast Toaster', 'REPLACE AIR CURTAINS', 'To replace: When the machine is cool, take a flat head screw driver and pry off old curtains to remove. Place one side of new curtain on the mounting peg and bend to place the other side on opposite peg. Front and Back Curtain Location (Pictures by AJ Atunes)', 7),
